<title>UK: Railtrack names Gerald Corbett CEO.</title>
<headline>Railtrack names Gerald Corbett CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British rail infrastructure operator Railtrack Group Plc said on Thursday it had appointed Gerald Corbett as chief executive.</p>
<p>Railtrack said Corbett, previously finance director at British food and drinks group Grand Metropolitan Plc, was expected to take up his post as chief executive on September 29.</p>
<p>Corbett succeeds John Edmonds, who is retiring, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
